{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/extras/1cfee5e12bc62e463c62af7dd2f1ab3c.avif?t=1761053318\" width=1200 height=250 /></span><br>Created by a solo developer, <strong>It\u2019s Not You, It\u2019s M.E.</strong> is a game you can\u2019t win \u2014 a brief, interactive story where everyday tasks and small challenges become overwhelming. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it\u2019s inspired by the lived experience of Long Covid and M.E., simulating one week in the life of a fictional version of the person who made it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short (around 10 minutes) narrative point-and-click includes a hidden mini-games that often feel impossible to complete. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Featuring original music by Jack The Robot.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with support from <strong>Disability and Deaf Arts Fest</strong> and <strong>FACT Gallery</strong>, and made possible thanks to <strong>public funding from the National Lottery through Arts Council England.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109440?t=1761053318","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/f5cbb0fba3aaaa25fd1ed60d929d9ae04c0d944e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761053318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/82702e5df929873f44ac7497a6e452fa18f9e190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761053318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/82702e5df929873f44ac7497a6e452fa18f9e190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761053318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/extras/1cfee5e12bc62e463c62af7dd2f1ab3c.avif?t=1761053318\" width=1200 height=250 /></span><br>Created by a solo developer, <strong>It\u2019s Not You, It\u2019s M.E.</strong> is a game you can\u2019t win \u2014 a brief, interactive story where everyday tasks and small challenges become overwhelming. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it\u2019s inspired by the lived experience of Long Covid and M.E., simulating one week in the life of a fictional version of the person who made it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short (around 10 minutes) narrative point-and-click includes a hidden mini-games that often feel impossible to complete. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Featuring original music by Jack The Robot.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with support from <strong>Disability and Deaf Arts Fest</strong> and <strong>FACT Gallery</strong>, and made possible thanks to <strong>public funding from the National Lottery through Arts Council England.</strong></p>","developers":["Closed Forum"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/6ae6b81c2a32d14fff94e53c3af745b874c153cb/header.jpg?t=1761053318","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109440/1114088767/9afac10f146060c45a4857818a6f669632163704/1761051908/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761052924","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109440/1114088767/9afac10f146060c45a4857818a6f669632163704/176105